{"id":"seg-030","text":"不能奋飞","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","title":"詩經注析","authors":["程俊英","蔣見元"],"contributorLine":"现代 · 程俊英、蔣見元","era":"现代","publicationYear":1991,"carrier":"PDF"},"stats":{"annotationCount":4,"glossCount":4},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"题解","targetNotes":"题解总说。","sourceLabel":"第 47-48 页","sourceNotes":"书内页 47-48《题解》段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"题解"}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":4,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"汎彼柏舟，亦汎其流。耿耿不寐，如有隐忧。微我无酒，以敖以游。","targetNotes":"首章。","sourceLabel":"第 48-49 页","sourceNotes":"书内页 48-49 首章及注释。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":null}]},{"id":"0003","order":3,"total":4,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"我心匪鉴，不可以茹。亦有兄弟，不可以据。薄言往愬，逢彼之怒。","targetNotes":"第二章。","sourceLabel":"第 49 页","sourceNotes":"书内页 49 第二章及注释。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0003-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":null}]},{"id":"0004","order":4,"total":4,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"我心匪石，不可转也。我心匪席，不可卷也。威仪棣棣，不可选也。忧心悄悄，愠于群小。觏闵既多，受侮不少。静言思之，寤辟有摽。日居月诸，胡迭而微？心之忧矣，如匪澣衣。静言思之，不能奋飞。","targetNotes":"第三至五章。","sourceLabel":"第 49 页","sourceNotes":"据题解末段与书内页 49 可见注释提要整理后三章。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0004-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":null}]}]}}}
